{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oc6GzDxJb10lZmud1Lzzsg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:46.256008+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/oc6GzDxJb10lZmud1Lzzsg","html":"<div><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   根据《兰州大学关于做好</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》（校研发〔2026〕22号）相关工作部署，为保障我院2027年推免生（直博生）招生复试录取工作规范有序开展，经文学院研究生招生工作领导小组研究，特制订本实施细则。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>一、组织领导</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   学院成立研究生招生工作领导小组，对我院研究生招生工作进行集体决策，对研究生招生全过程实施领导和监督，全面负责学院的研究生招生工作。</span></span></span><span><span>    </span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>二、招收专业</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   1.学术学位：中国语言文学、艺术学</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   2.专业学位：国际中文教育</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、接收条件</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  （一）具有推荐免试资格高校的应届本科毕业生，并获得所在学校的推荐免试资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  （二）德、智、体、美、劳全面发展，遵纪守法，诚实守信，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  （三）在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较好的专业素养，有较强的创新意识和创新能力，有较高的培养潜质。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>  （四）无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪等受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   申请直接攻读博士学位的推免生（以下简称</span></span></span><span><span><span>“直博生”），须具有较强科研创新能力，其全国大学英语六级考试成绩达到425分、雅思6.0分、托福旧版90分（新版4.5分）及以上或具有其他同等水平外语证明，并有两名所报考学科专业领域内的教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的书面推荐意见。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、招收程序</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   1.有意申请我院推荐免试的学生，请于2026年9月1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>日中午</span></span></span><span><span><span>12:00前登录兰州大学推免生预接收报名系统(http://yjszs.lzu.edu.cn/lzuyjsytms/wlogin.html)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span><span><span><span>提交个人基本信息，相关材料申请（材料可包括申请攻读研究生报告及本科成绩单、外语水平证明、科研创新证明、重要奖项证书等支撑材料）</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>(前期已经提交预报名信息但申请材料不全的，可在学院审核前重新提交并保存</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>已审核通过的无需再次提交</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。学院将分批开展相关考核预录取工作。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>    2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span> </span></span><span><span><span><span><span>通过考核被我院预录取且获得所在本科院校推免资格的学生，在教育部</span></span></span><span><span><span>“推免服务系统”</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span> </span></span><span><span><span>(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>开通后，应及时按要求填报相应信息和志愿，并在</span></span></span><span><span><span>“推免服务系统”中确认复试通知和待录取通知。未在教育部“推免服务系统”中选报兰州大学的学生，视为放弃相关资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>    3.最终录取以教育部“推免服务系统”录取结果为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>五、综合考核</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   综合考核包括材料审核、笔试（仅直博生）、专业面试、外语口语及听力测试、思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（一）材料审核</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   申请我院推荐免试的学生，请于预报名截止时间前提交线上申请，附件材料以</span></span></span><span><span><span>PDF形式上传至兰州大学推免生预接收报名系统，命名要求：姓名+报考专业（硕士/直博生），材料清单及顺序如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>1）身份证。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>2）《学生证》或《教育部学籍在线验证报告》。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>3）申请攻读研究生报告。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>4）所在院校有关部门加盖公章的成绩单以及成绩排名。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>5）外国语水平考试成绩单（CET4、CET6、IELTS、TOEFL）以及本人认为有必要提供的其他材料。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>6）已获得的有关学术成果，包括发表的论文、出版的专著或承担的课题、重要获奖证书等。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span><span><span><span>7）本人亲笔签字的《兰州大学研究生诚信应试承诺书》（附件1）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   学院根据相关要求对材料进行审核评分，作为推免接收参考。材料审核评分不计入综合考核成绩。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   请妥善保存以上材料的纸质原件，提供形式以后续复试通知中要求为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   申请直博生者，材料提交要求以《兰州大学文学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>2026年博士研究生招生“申请－考核”实施方案》为准，提交《直博生申请表》（附件3）与《专家推荐书》（附件4）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>（二）面试考核</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   面试是推免生（直博生）综合考核的必要环节，主要考察学生的创新能力、专业素养和综合素质等。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   对通过材料审核且学院同意面试的推免生（直博生），参照《兰州大学关于做好</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》《文学院2026年博士研究生招生“申请－考核”实施方案》及本实施细则有关要求组织推免生（直博生）的面试工作。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   我院将采取线上线下等多种方式，分批多次组织复试考核工作，具体时间及形式以学院各专业面试组通知为准。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   面试包括：专业面试、外语口语及听力测试，满分</span></span></span><span><span><span>100分。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   硕士推免生综合考核总成绩</span></span></span><span><span><span>=专业面试成绩×80%+外语口语及听力测试成绩×20%。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   直博生综合考核成绩计算按博士研究生招生</span></span></span><span><span><span>“申请－考核”实施方案进行。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   复试综合考核成绩通过兰州大学推免生预接收报名系统公布。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   我院对参加复试的推免生（直博生）不收取复试报名考试费。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>六、思想政治素质和品德考核</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   思想政治素质和品德考核重点考察考生政治态度、思想表现、道德品质、遵纪守法、诚实守信、学风表现。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   复试阶段考生须如实填写《兰州大学复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表》（附件</span></span></span><span><span><span>2），扫描件发送至文学院研招邮箱，扫描件命名格式：预推免专业+姓名，纸质原件考生自行留存。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>七、体检</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   推免生（直博生）体检统一安排在新生入学报到阶段，在校医院完成。体检标准参照《教育部、卫生部、中国残疾人联合会关于印发</span></span></span><span><span><span>&lt;普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见&gt;的通知》（教学〔2003〕3号）。体检不合格，经复检仍然达不到国家入学体检标准，取消入学资格。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>八、录取</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   学院根据推免生的复试成绩、思想政治素质和品德考核，提出拟录取名单，并报研究生院审核。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   1.综合考核成绩不合格者不予录取,思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   2.对未能达到直博生录取要求，但符合我校硕士推免生录取要求者，在招生学院和本人同意的情况下可转报硕士推免生予以录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   3.报考专项计划未能拟录取的学生可转为普通计划，经考核合格后予以录取。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   4.所有录取的直博生均须确定指导教师，接收直博生的导师须符合学院和学校相关要求。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>九、材料接收</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   电子邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span>wxyygz@lzu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   联系人：刘老师</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   联系电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>0931-5501918</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   办公地点：榆中校区宏远楼</span></span></span><span><span><span>B208、城关校区明道楼214办公室</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   学院网页：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>https://chinese.lzu.edu.cn/</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span>十、其他</span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>   本细则未尽事宜，遵照兰州大学《关于做好</span></span></span><span><span><span>2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作的通知》（校研发〔2026〕22号）以及研究生院相关文件执行。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>附件1：《兰州大学研究生诚信应试承诺书》</span></span></p><p><span><span>附件2：《兰州大学复试考生思想政治素质和品德考核情况表》</span></span></p><p><span><span>附件3：《直博生申请表》</span></span></p><p><span><span>附件4：《专家推荐书》</span></span></p><p><span><span> </span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>                                        兰州大学文学院</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>2026年9月9日</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7f20d92cae7ef00d9e805495882499dbd31040cb6511f68222ae56c96ab5949a","textLength":2550,"sourceSha256":"1f917e36045468c35683813cea142969866c90ceccb8ecd3b9abb2bccd8063ae","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5438a915ff78ba8dd7cb","title":"2026年兰州大学文学院2027年推免生（直博生）复试录取工作实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:46.256008+00:00"}
